  "description": "From kilos to pursuits, madisons to scratch races, the Trackmachine 01 is made to do one job well: go fast on the boards.\nDesigned as a collaboration between the BMC Impec Lab and Swiss Cycling, it brings our aerodynamic engineering together with our high-grade 01 Premium Carbon layup in a frameset that works across all track events.\nThe wide-leg Halo fork manages airflow at speed, while adjustable steel rear dropouts allow exact setup for different race demands. A threaded bottom bracket ensures reliability through repeated efforts, and the aerodynamic seatpost supports a stable, power-driven position.\nCompatible with any 1⅛” stem or BMC base bar, the Trackmachine is not dramatic. It is exact. And that’s why it wins.",
